\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 You are an expert Python developer and web scraping engineer.\
\
I want you to help me design and implement a **Python script** that scrapes biographical information about Chilean MPs from the website of the Biblioteca del Congreso Nacional (BCN) and outputs a **single JSON file** with a list of records (one record per person) following a specific JSON structure.\
\
The site is:\
\
- Main listing example (parliamentarians by period):\
  https://www.bcn.cl/historiapolitica/resenas_parlamentarias/index.html?categ=por_periodo&periodo=1990-2018&pagina=7&=1#listado_parlamentarios\
\
From that listing, each name links to a detail page of the form:\
\
- Example detail page:\
  https://www.bcn.cl/historiapolitica/resenas_parlamentarias/wiki/Felipe_Jos%C3%A9_Kast_Sommerhoff\
\
Each detail page contains:\
- An \'93infobox\'94 on the right with a lot of structured information (name, birth, profession, party, parliamentary career, public offices, external links, etc.).\
- A main body with several sections (family and youth, studies, political career, recognitions, legislatures, etc.).\
- A \'93Labor Parlamentaria\'94 section with tabs like: \'93Labor Legislativa\'94, \'93Incidentes\'94, \'93Homenajes\'94, \'93Comisiones y grupos\'94, \'93Permisos y otros\'94.\
\
Inside **\'93Comisiones y grupos\'94** there are buttons, one of which is:\
\
```html\
<button class="tablinks2 btn btn-default" onclick="openTab2(event, '949')">Intervenci\'f3n en Comision</button>\
```\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 When the user clicks \'93Intervenci\'f3n en Comision\'94, the browser makes an AJAX/XHR request to an endpoint like:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs26 \cf0 getParticipaciones.html?id=949&id_persona=4030
\f1\fs24 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\fs26 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 id=949
\f1\fs24  means the type of record \'93Intervenci\'f3n en Comision\'94.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\fs26 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 id_persona
\f1\fs24  is the person identifier (for Felipe Jos\'e9 Kast Sommerhoff, the example id_persona is 4030).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The response of that AJAX request is an HTML fragment containing a table, with at least two columns:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
